        "node_id": "n_2_f43a21",
        "thought_text": "The error in the code is due to an incorrect indexing in the loop that builds the tree structure. The loop should iterate from 1 to n, not from 2 to n+1. This causes an IndexError when trying to access superiors[i-2] for the last element. Let's modify the loop to fix this issue.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
